  "description": "Drive a Reachy Mini from a browser over WebRTC, signalled through Hugging Face. A SpawnJS wrapper over @pollen-robotics/reachy-mini-sdk that implements SpawnDev.Reachy's IReachyMotion and IReachyLifecycle, so ReachyBody's gesture library, measured motion envelope and idle life run unchanged against a remote robot. This is the only route from a page served over HTTPS: the robot's daemon speaks plain HTTP on the LAN, which a secure page may not touch.",
  "iconFile": "icon-128.png",
